'''Easter Duche''' (イースタールンルン, ''Īsutā Runrun'', '''Easter Runrun''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in [[Cats Abloom!#Spring Sprang Sprung|Spring Sprang Sprung]]. She was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

